---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <div class="bg-sage-50">
        <div class="h-full mx-auto">
            <div class="p-10 mb-10 flex justify-center">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
                    <span class="text-3xl text-cocoa title">
                        “Where creativity, care, and courage always start at
                        home.” — Mailan Home Bakery
                    </span>

                    <a
                        href="/recipes"
                        class="my-5 rounded-lg bg-sage-700 px-8 py-3 text-center text-3xl font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-sage-800 focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-sage-700"
                    >
                        EXPLORE RECIPES
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-15 justify-center w-full">
                <div class="flex items-center flex-col gap-4 text-center">
                    <span class="text-3xl charcoal title">
                        {" "}
                        Mailan — A Legacy Stitched with Love
                    </span>
                    <p id="body" class="text-xl charcoal title">
                        Mailan is more than a name — it’s a legacy stitched
                        together by love, family, and creativity. After giving
                        birth to me, my mom opened her own tailor shop in our
                        small hometown in Vietnam — named after herself and her
                        sister: Mai and Lan. Mai — the Vietnamese Mickey-Mouse
                        flower or yellow apricot blossom, blooms every Lunar New
                        Year and symbolizes prosperity, hope, and new
                        beginnings. Lan — Orchid, delicate and graceful,
                        representing beauty, strength, and enduring love. My
                        name, Quynh, also comes from a flower — the
                        Night-Blooming Epiphyllum or Queen of the Night. It
                        blooms only once, symbolizing rare beauty and quiet
                        resilience. Together, Mai, Lan, and Quynh form the heart
                        of Mailan Bakery — a story of women, family, and flowers
                        that bloom in their own time.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
